WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.801 --> 00:00:05.331
PayBridge — an educational sandbox for UAE → India business payments. No real money moves.

2
00:00:05.331 --> 00:00:15.571
Follow one payment through FX, compliance, the ledger, the provider and reconciliation.

3
00:00:15.571 --> 00:00:21.570
Sign in with a demo account. First, the Maker.

4
00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:25.534
The overview: balance, volume, payment status and recent payments.

5
00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:27.114
New payment: choose the beneficiary — Acme India Pvt Ltd, Mumbai.

6
00:00:27.114 --> 00:00:32.510
Lock an AED → INR quote: rate, spread and fee shown up front, valid for 60 seconds.

7
00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:37.318
Compliance rules run before the payment is submitted.

8
00:00:37.318 --> 00:00:39.374
Review and submit. Funds are held in the ledger straight away.

9
00:00:39.374 --> 00:00:47.724
Payment created — it now needs a second person to approve it (maker-checker).

10
00:00:47.724 --> 00:00:55.041
Now the Approver signs in and approves.

11
00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:59.838
The mock provider processes the payout and reports back with signed webhooks.

12
00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:03.873
Paid. Hold, capture and settlement are posted — debits equal credits in every currency.

13
00:01:03.873 --> 00:01:08.291
Every compliance rule is listed with its result.

14
00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:12.965
Finally, a platform admin runs reconciliation.

15
00:01:12.965 --> 00:01:18.985
Webhooks: received, signature verified, persisted, then applied — once.

16
00:01:18.985 --> 00:01:23.239
Reconciliation compares the internal payment, the provider record and the ledger.

17
00:01:23.239 --> 00:01:28.458
Matched: expected and received amounts agree, with zero difference.

18
00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:32.962
Created → Compliance → Approved → Processing → Paid → Reconciled.

19
00:01:32.962 --> 00:01:35.965
PayBridge · Educational Sandbox — No Real Money Movement.
